ile leftovers only pay small storage costs. A product 0 shortfall costs only 7, while unsold product 0 spoils at 12 per unit.\n  - Candidate 7 orders 20% over for both products. The extra product 0 is likely to spoil.\n- **Shared problem.** The first deliveries arrive on day 3 (product 1) and day 4 (product 0), so every plan runs short in the first few days.\n\n**My top four:** 6, 5, 3 and 7. Candidates 0 and 4 are the closest to that group; 1 and 2 are clearly below it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4547, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4547}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:42:15.100Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVSXhQocMTQSfSNBq62H"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01ShU8uhHpqaKyecTvXZrum6", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVSXhfRzq9ZbGheEiQJj", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01ShU8uhHpqaKyecTvXZrum6", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.45, 0.35, 0.1, 0.6, 0.4, 0.7, 0.75, 0.55]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4547, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_to